  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn></math></p><p>As the light is propagating in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> direction.</p><p>&amp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>|</mo><mo>|</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> should be in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math> direction.</p><p>So electric field <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>sin</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>36</mn><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>11</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mfrac></math></p>"
